{"content": "<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"New players hero\"},\"className\":\"hero\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|80\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"1240px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group hero\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\t<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"hero-tag\"} -->\n\t\t<p class=\"hero-tag\">New to hockey?</p>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"textColor\":\"cream\"} -->\n\t\t<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-cream-color has-text-color\">You don't need to know <em>anything</em> to start.</h1>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} -->\n\t\t<p class=\"lead\">Everyone at Mentone started somewhere. Whether you've never held a stick or you're coming back after years away \u2014 we've got a spot for you.</p>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\t\t<!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\"}}}} -->\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:button -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.revolutionise.com.au/mentonehockey/club-registrations\">Register for 2026</a></div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:button -->\n\t\t\t<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-ghost\"} -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-ghost\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"mailto:secretary@mentonehockey.org.au\">Ask us anything</a></div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /wp:button -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Common questions\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"1240px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\n\t<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"section-head\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide section-head\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n\t\t<p class=\"eyebrow\">Common questions</p>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Things people <em>always ask.</em></h2>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n\t<!-- wp:html -->\n\t<div class=\"faq-grid alignwide\">\n\t\t<div class=\"faq-card\">\n\t\t\t<h4>Do I need to have played before?</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Not at all. We have teams and programs for complete beginners through to Premier League \u2014 if you've never played, Hook in2 Hockey for kids or a Metro grade for adults is the perfect starting point.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"faq-card\">\n\t\t\t<h4>What gear do I need?</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>To start, just a mouthguard and shinpads. We can lend sticks while you figure out if it's for you. Once you're registered, check the <a href=\"/uniforms/\">uniforms page</a> for playing kit, ordering windows and clash requirements.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"faq-card\">\n\t\t\t<h4>How much does it cost?</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Like most community sports clubs, we run on volunteers \u2014 fees cover umpires, ground hire, equipment and Hockey Victoria levies. <a href=\"#registration\">Full 2026 fees and how registration works are right here on this page</a>.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"faq-card\">\n\t\t\t<h4>When do I need to decide?</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Happens sometimes \u2014 and that's completely fine. Come along to a training session first, meet the team and see if it feels right. No obligation to register on the spot.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"faq-card\">\n\t\t\t<h4>I'm transferring from another club.</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Welcome. Just get in touch with the relevant section coordinator and we'll guide you through the transfer process with Hockey Victoria. It's straightforward.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"faq-card\">\n\t\t\t<h4>Can I come along before registering?</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Yes. Come to training, have a hit, meet people. We'd rather you come down and get a feel for the club before committing. Just let the coordinator know you're coming.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Find your section\"},\"backgroundColor\":\"blue-wash\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"1240px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-blue-wash-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\n\t<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"section-head\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide section-head\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n\t\t<p class=\"eyebrow\">Find your fit</p>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Which section is <em>right for you?</em></h2>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n\t<!-- wp:html -->\n\t<div class=\"section-pick-grid alignwide\">\n\t\t<a class=\"section-pick-card\" href=\"/juniors/\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-pick-tag\">Ages 5 \u2013 18</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Juniors</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>From Hook in2 Hockey through to U18 \u2014 the best place to start.</p>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"section-pick-more\">Learn more \u2192</span>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a class=\"section-pick-card\" href=\"/mens/\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-pick-tag\">Men's</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Men's section</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Premier League to Metro \u2014 competitive and social grades for all abilities.</p>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"section-pick-more\">Learn more \u2192</span>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a class=\"section-pick-card\" href=\"/womens/\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-pick-tag\">Women's</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Women's section</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>A strong, inclusive program from Premier League through to Metro.</p>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"section-pick-more\">Learn more \u2192</span>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a class=\"section-pick-card\" href=\"/masters/\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-pick-tag\">Over 35s</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Masters</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Men's and Women's Masters \u2014 great hockey, great company.</p>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"section-pick-more\">Learn more \u2192</span>\n\t\t</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Registration and fees\"},\"backgroundColor\":\"blue-wash\",\"anchor\":\"registration\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"1240px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-blue-wash-background-color has-background\" id=\"registration\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"section-head\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide section-head\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Registration &amp; fees</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Two registrations &mdash; <em>one game.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"section-sub\"} -->\n<p class=\"section-sub\">Every player completes both. It&rsquo;s one online flow &mdash; the club portal takes you straight through.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"faq-grid alignwide\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n<div class=\"faq-card\">\n<h4>1 &middot; Mentone club registration</h4>\n<p>Done first, through our club portal. This is the club fee &mdash; umpires, ground hire, equipment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discounts applied automatically (goalie, multi-child, sibling)</li>\n<li>Payment plans available as you register</li>\n<li>18+ to register yourself or others &middot; card required</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><a href=\"https://mentonehockey.majestri.com.au/2026-winter-season\">Register for the 2026 winter season &rarr;</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"faq-card\">\n<h4>2 &middot; Hockey Victoria registration</h4>\n<p>Compulsory for every player in Victoria &mdash; your insurance and HV levies for the year.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The club portal takes you straight there after step 1</li>\n<li>Already HV-registered for 2026 (Indoor, Summer, Academies)? Skip it</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.hockeyvictoria.org.au/competitions-events/register-now/\">About HV registration &rarr;</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"fees-table-wrap alignwide\" style=\"max-width:860px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\">\n<table class=\"fees-table\">\n<thead><tr><th>2026 winter season</th><th>Fee</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Juniors</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Game On! (Under 8)</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$40</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Under 10</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$70</td></tr>\n<tr><td>U12 / U14 / U16 / U18 competition</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$410</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Seniors</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Senior Men / Women</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$740</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Concession &mdash; full-time student or Health Care Card</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$630</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Midweek &amp; Masters</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Midweek Open / Masters competition only</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$550</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Goalkeepers (own gear)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Junior goalkeeper</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$250</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Senior goalkeeper</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$360</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Midweek / Masters goalkeeper</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$360</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Playing more than one comp</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Also playing Seniors, Masters or Midweek</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$250</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Goalkeeper also playing another comp</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$180</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Casual fill-in</td></tr>\n<tr><td>1&ndash;5 games</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$190</td></tr>\n<tr><td>6&ndash;10 games</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$350</td></tr>\n<tr><td>10+ games</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$740</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"fee-group\"><td colspan=\"2\">Social &middot; levies &middot; discounts</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Social membership</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$50</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Volunteer Levy &mdash; every player except U8/U10, reimbursable</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">$100</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sibling discount &mdash; 2nd &amp; subsequent junior player</td><td class=\"fee-amount\">&minus;$50</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"alignwide\">\n<ul class=\"check-list\" style=\"margin-top:40px;max-width:860px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\">\n<li><span>Open to all sections &mdash; Juniors, Senior Men &amp; Women, Masters Men &amp; Women</span></li>\n<li><span>Pick your <strong>Primary Playing Category</strong> first, then add extras. Junior also playing seniors? Register as <strong>Juniors</strong>. Masters also playing weekends? Register as <strong>Seniors</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span>Monday and Wednesday midweek comps are charged separately</span></li>\n<li><span>Can&rsquo;t commit to a full season? Casual fill-in categories have you covered</span></li>\n<li><span>The $100 Volunteer Levy is payable at registration and reimbursable &mdash; the club&rsquo;s FAQ guides explain how</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-top:48px;\">Key dates</div>\n<div class=\"age-grid-4\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n<div class=\"age-card\">\n<div class=\"age-card-num\">Now</div>\n<div class=\"age-card-label\">Registrations</div>\n<p>2026 winter season registration is open across all sections.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"age-card\">\n<div class=\"age-card-num\">8 Feb</div>\n<div class=\"age-card-label\">Hook in2 Hockey</div>\n<p>Kids program runs 8 February to 5 September.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);\">Season fixture dates land here once Hockey Victoria confirms the draw.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);max-width:860px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\">Stuck, or not sure what applies to you? Email <a href=\"mailto:treasurer@mentonehockey.org.au\" style=\"color:var(--yellow-deep);border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;padding-bottom:1px;\">treasurer@mentonehockey.org.au</a></p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"How to join\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|90\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"wideSize\":\"1240px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--90);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n\n\t<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"section-head\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide section-head\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"eyebrow\"} -->\n\t\t<p class=\"eyebrow\">How to join</p>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\t\t<!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} -->\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Three steps to <em>getting started.</em></h2>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n\t<!-- wp:html -->\n\t<div class=\"steps-grid-3 alignwide\">\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"step-num\">01</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Get in touch</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Email the coordinator for your section, or just drop us a line at <a href=\"mailto:secretary@mentonehockey.org.au\">secretary@mentonehockey.org.au</a>. We'll point you in the right direction.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"step-num\">02</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Come to training</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>Come along, have a hit and meet the team. Training details are on the section pages. You don't need to register first \u2014 just show up.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"step-num\">03</div>\n\t\t\t<h4>Register online</h4>\n\t\t\t<p>When you're ready, registrations are completed online through our club portal. Takes about five minutes and you're set for the season.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n\t<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}}} -->\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\">\n\t\t<!-- wp:button -->\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.revolutionise.com.au/mentonehockey/club-registrations\">Register for 2026</a></div>\n\t\t<!-- /wp:button -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n"}